<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="0f647518-d163-4acb-a718-5e871af4f320" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>St. Peter's Basilica</Name>
    <Teaser>St. Peter's Basilica, officially Basilica Papale di San Pietro in Vaticano, is a large Catholic Cathedral located in the Vatican</Teaser>
    <Description>St. Peter's Basilica, officially Basilica Papale di San Pietro in Vaticano, is a large Roman Catholic Cathedral located in the Vatican City. It is among the holiest sites of the Catholic faith, and is said to be built over the tomb of the Basilica's namesake, Saint Peter. Construction took place across the 16th and 17th centuries, being completed on 18 November 1626. Ingame, St. Peter's Basilica provides a free Cathedral in the city in which it is built, +2 Faith in the city for every Social policy from the Piety tree adopted, and requires Acoustics.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai</Authors>
